        "kind": "release",
        "notes": "• Any till tab sends a left-open till's cashier to Sell to close it first\n• Warn when the change is more than the drawer holds (opened at zero after banking)\n• No \"continue last count\" after a close that banked the cash\n• An empty drawer opens at zero again (karots-pos allowed it\n• The till makes a cashier close a till left open\n• Flag tills left open from an earlier day and cash taken with no till open\n• Close a till for its cashier (admin / manager)\n• Admins lock a screen from Who's on now\n• A game on the lock screen shows as Playing … on Who's on now\n• Who's on now on the dashboard, live dot on Users\n• Every signed-in screen and the lock page send a heartbeat\n• Heartbeat + admin Who's on now API\n• Live users store"
